      "title": "Center for Career and Professional Development",
      "description": "Center for Career and Professional Development –  | Kalamazoo College Skip to main content quicklinks ▼ ✗ Academic admin council Academic calendar Academic stds committee Accessiblity at K Admission Advising African studies Alcohol & other drugs Alumni engagement American studies Anthropology/sociology Arabic Arboretum Archives Arcus center Art Hornet sports Athletic training Biology Biology & chem center Bookstore BrandK Business office Campus event calendar Campus safety Career & professional dev Careers in health Catalog Cauldron Ctr for civic engagement Ctr for international pgrms Chemistry & Biochemistry Chinese Classics College communication Community & global health Community council Complex systems studies Commencement Computer science Copyright Counseling Crisis response Critical ethnic studies Critical theory Development Dining services Directories Disability services Diversity, equity, inclusion Donor relations East Asian studies Economics & business Educational policies committee Engineering Environmental stewardship Environmental studies English Experiential education committee Facilities management Facilities reservations Faculty development committee Faculty executive committee Faculty grants Faculty personnel committee Fellowships and grants Festival playhouse Film & media studies Financial aid First year experience Fitness wellness center French Gardens & growing spaces German Global crossroads Health center Health science Jewish studies History Hornet hive Hornet HQ Human resources Humanities Integrated Locational Learning Inclusive excellence Index (student newspaper) Information services Institutional assessment Institutional research Institutional review board Intercultural student life International area studies International programs Intramural sports Japanese KCCSR Council of student reps LandSea Learning commons Learning support Lgbtqai+ student resources Library Mail & copy center Math Math/physics center Microsoft Stream Microsoft Teams Mobile app Moodle Music OneDrive Outdoor programs Parents' resources Payroll Phi Beta Kappa Philharmonia Philosophy Physics Physical education Political science Pre-law advising Provost Psychology Public policy urban affairs Recycling Registrar Religion Religious & spiritual life Research Guides (libguides) Residential life Safety (security) Sexual safety Shared passages program SharePoint online Sophomore experience Spanish Strategic plan Student accounts Student development Student activities Student organizations Study abroad Support staff Sustainability Teaching & learning committee Teaching commons Theatre arts Title IX Webmail Women, gender, sexuality Writing center About K K-Plan Academics Admission Alumni GIVE News Life at K Athletics APPLY Close Navigation Center for Career and Professional Development Home Students Explore Your Path Beyond K Families All Student Resources Employers On-Campus Employers Employer Resources Alumni Faculty/Advisors Advisor Playbook Faculty Resources Impact Home What can we help you find? Search Search The CCPD is here to support you as you: CONSIDER your values, strengths, and interests as you build your K-Plan and plan for Life after K. COMMUNICATE your knowledge, skills and experiences effectively verbally, in writing and online to access career opportunities. CONNECT with employers, alumni and other professionals to explore interest areas and test out career options. Start your journey by dropping by the Career Studio . Or begin by checking out our Resources . Latest News: Lessons from a Startup Internship See What We Built Together: CCPD’s 2025–26 Impact Report Inside a Photographic Archive in Rome Learning Beyond the Classroom: A Student-Led Day in Lansing What our Alumni Tell Us Reflection to Direction: Supporting Sophomores as They Explore What Comes Next Upcoming Events: See a full list of upcoming events in Handshake . Wednesday September 30 @ 3:00 - 5:00 pm . Dewing Commons Employer Connection Fair Wednesday October 7 @ 11:00 am - 1:00 pm . TBD Career Studio Takeover – University of Michigan Ross School of Business Wednesday January 20 @ 3:00 - 5:00 pm . Dewing Commons Employer Connection Fair Access Online, 24/7: Handshake : Search for on-campus and off-campus jobs, register for events, or schedule a 1:1 appointment with a career coach. Career Connection Toolkit : Access a growing collection of online modules at your own pace. Learn how to create a basic resume, tailor it for specific opportunities, and connect with alumni for career exploration and mentorship. PathwayU : Utilize this online predictive guidance platform to connect to your greatest sense of purpose as you make choices throughout your education, career, and employment journey. KConnect : Connect with alumni and students on Kalamazoo College’s official networking platform to get career advice, mentorship, and job leads. Big Interview & Big Resume : Practice interview skills and get instant feedback on your resume using these online tools. What can I do with this major? : Explore career paths linked to every K major and find resources to plan your next steps. Forage : Complete free job simulations designed by employers to gain experience without applying or interviewing. Updated August 19, 2026 by Rachel Wood Contact CCPD 269.337.7183 Career@kzoo.edu About Us Meet the CCPD Staff! Meet the CCPD Pets! Our Mission News Address Dewing Hall 1200 Academy St Kalamazoo, MI 49006 Social Media Instagram YouTube Contact Info Kalamazoo College 1200 Academy Street Kalamazoo, Michigan 49006-3295 USA Information 269.337.7000 Admission 800.253.3602 Contact List Directories Search this site Sitemap Map and Directions Academic Calendars Employment Departments and Programs Library Registrar Bookstore For Parents Crisis Response Nondiscrimination Policy Title IX Bias Reporting Consumer Information Web Accessibility Policy Privacy Policy Official Disclaimer © Kalamazoo College All Rights Reserved 2018"
