    "https://facultygrants.kzoo.edu/": {
      "title": "Faculty Grant Assistance",
      "description": "Faculty Grant Assistance –  | Kalamazoo College Skip to main content quicklinks ▼ ✗ Academic admin council Academic calendar Academic stds committee Accessiblity at K Admission Advising African studies Alcohol & other drugs Alumni engagement American studies Anthropology/sociology Arabic Arboretum Archives Arcus center Art Hornet sports Athletic training Biology Biology & chem center Bookstore BrandK Business office Campus event calendar Campus safety Career & professional dev Careers in health Catalog Cauldron Ctr for civic engagement Ctr for international pgrms Chemistry & Biochemistry Chinese Classics College communication Community & global health Community council Complex systems studies Commencement Computer science Copyright Counseling Crisis response Critical ethnic studies Critical theory Development Dining services Directories Disability services Diversity, equity, inclusion Donor relations East Asian studies Economics & business Educational policies committee Engineering Environmental stewardship Environmental studies English Experiential education committee Facilities management Facilities reservations Faculty development committee Faculty executive committee Faculty grants Faculty personnel committee Fellowships and grants Festival playhouse Film & media studies Financial aid First year experience Fitness wellness center French Gardens & growing spaces German Global crossroads Health center Health science Jewish studies History Hornet hive Hornet HQ Human resources Humanities Integrated Locational Learning Inclusive excellence Index (student newspaper) Information services Institutional assessment Institutional research Institutional review board Intercultural student life International area studies International programs Intramural sports Japanese KCCSR Council of student reps LandSea Learning commons Learning support Lgbtqai+ student resources Library Mail & copy center Math Math/physics center Microsoft Stream Microsoft Teams Mobile app Moodle Music OneDrive Outdoor programs Parents' resources Payroll Phi Beta Kappa Philharmonia Philosophy Physics Physical education Political science Pre-law advising Provost Psychology Public policy urban affairs Recycling Registrar Religion Religious & spiritual life Research Guides (libguides) Residential life Safety (security) Sexual safety Shared passages program SharePoint online Sophomore experience Spanish Strategic plan Student accounts Student development Student activities Student organizations Study abroad Support staff Sustainability Teaching & learning committee Teaching commons Theatre arts Title IX Webmail Women, gender, sexuality Writing center About K K-Plan Academics Admission Alumni GIVE News Life at K Athletics APPLY Close Navigation Faculty Grant Assistance Home Opportunities Apply Pre-Award Budget Information Rates and Other Useful Information Conflict of Interest Disclosure Form Award Not Funded? Policies Conflict of Interest Policy Conflict of Interest Disclosure Form Link Faculty Handbook Intellectual Property Policy Purchasing Policies Research with Human Subjects Policies and Procedures for Addressing Allegations of Research Misconduct (2026) Research Misconduct Policy Responsible Conduct of Research Policy and Training Plan Student Research Conduct Policy Travel Policy Staff Research Hub Home Grant Assistance for Faculty The Director of Faculty Grants assists faculty in applying for external funding to support research, creative, curricular, community, and outreach endeavors by: Identifying potential funding sources Interpreting agency and foundation guidelines, policies, and procedures Helping with proposal preparation Helping to develop proposal budgets Coordinating internal proposal sign-off procedures Assisting with grant administration Faculty are encouraged to meet with the Director or Faculty Grants at any time to discuss research interests, professional goals, and possibilities for external funding. Should I start with the Office of Faculty Grants or with Corporate and Foundation Relations? Work with the Office of Faculty Grants if you are seeking support for your individual research, creative work, curriculum development, or community projects.  Also start with the Office of Faculty Grants for any type of federal funding. Work with Corporate and Foundation Relations if you are seeking funding for a project that is an institutional priority.  Also work with Corporate and Foundation Relations if you are applying to a local community foundation.  The Director of Corporate and Foundation Relations manages the College’s relationships with local community foundations and serves as the point person for communicating with foundation representatives. Not sure where to start? Check in with the Office of Faculty Grants. Jessica can point you in the right direction. View the Faculty Research Advice Column to hear about your colleagues’ experiences. Dr. Rachel Love Director, Faculty Grants & Research, SMBE Learning Center Upjohn Library Commons, First Floor rachel.love@kzoo.edu Maria Newhouse Director of Corporate & Foundation Relations Mandelle, Third Floor maria.new h ouse@kzoo.edu 269.337.7297 Updated September 30, 2025 by Jessica Fowle Location Dewing Hall, First Floor 1200 Academy St, Kalamazoo, MI 49006 Contact Dr. Rachel Love rachel.love@kzoo.edu call via Microsoft Teams Contact Info Kalamazoo College 1200 Academy Street Kalamazoo, Michigan 49006-3295 USA Information 269.337.7000 Admission 800.253.3602 Contact List Directories Search this site Sitemap Map and Directions Academic Calendars Employment Departments and Programs Library Registrar Bookstore For Parents Crisis Response Nondiscrimination Policy Title IX Bias Reporting Consumer Information Web Accessibility Policy Privacy Policy Official Disclaimer © Kalamazoo College All Rights Reserved 2018"
    },
